 ╭─ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
 │ navigate                                   review                                              queue                                            symbols                                              │
 │ j/k ↓/↑    next/previous row               enter R    review the PR, or go to its tab          .          show drafts, bots, and reviewed PRs   ●          waits on your review (blue)               │
 │ [ ]        previous/next stack or author              selection or a stack: open tabs behind   /          filter by author, title, team, …      ●          waits on another review (peach)           │
 │ gg/G       top/bottom                      space      mark a PR, or a stack's PRs for you      ctrl+r     refresh now                           ○ ✓        in a stack for context / merged           │
 │ ctrl+d/u   half page                       v          visual range                             esc        clear selection, then filter          ◆ ◇        selected: for you / context               │
 │ J/K        scroll the details              o          open in the browser                      ?          help                                  ▎          a tab is reviewing it                     │
 │ l →        unfold the stack                y          copy URL(s)                              q          quit                                  ┊          folded PRs that are not for you           │
 │ h ←        fold the stack                  Y          copy branch name(s)                                                                       on #12     based on that PR's branch, not trunk      │
 │                                                                                                                                                 ✓1 ✗1      others approved / requested changes       │
 │                                                                                                                                                 ✓ ✗ ●      checks passed / failed / running          │
 │                                                                                                                                                                                                      │
 │ you                                                                                                                                                                                                  │
 │ review     asked, not reviewed yet                                                                                                                                                                   │
 │ re-review  asked again, or changed since                                                                                                                                                             │
 │ waiting    you reviewed, author's turn                                                                                                                                                               │
 │ approved   you approved                                                                                                                                                                              │
 │ via you    asked by name, else the team                                                                                                                                                              │
